 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "At a degree-$n$ closed point, the local Frobenius operator of\n[def-weil-local-frobenius-trace] acts on the constant stalk by\nidentity (the $n$-fold iterate of the geometric Frobenius of\n[def-weil-global-geometric-frobenius] fixes the constant section\n$1$), whose complex absolute value is $1=q^{n\\cdot0/2}=q_y^{0/2}$\nas required by [def-weil-punctual-weights].",
   "uses": [
    "def-weil-local-frobenius-trace",
